sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant B as Booking
    participant S as Seat
    participant P as Payment
    participant G as Gateway
    participant N as Notification

    C->>B: POST /bookings {eventId, seats, customerEmail}
    B->>S: POST /seats/hold {bookingId, eventId, seats}
    S-->>B: 200 HELD (all or none) / 409 SEAT_UNAVAILABLE
    B-->>C: 201 {bookingId, status: HELD, holdExpiresAt}

    C->>B: POST /bookings/{id}/pay (Idempotency-Key: k1)
    Note over B: save k1 as IN_PROGRESS (PK)<br/>BR3 check: HELD and not expired<br/>claim booking (pay_lock)
    B->>P: POST /payments (Idempotency-Key: k1)
    P->>G: POST /charge (timeout 5s)

    alt Happy path: gateway OK
        G-->>P: 200 APPROVED
        P-->>B: 201 {paymentId, APPROVED}
        B->>S: POST /seats/confirm
        S-->>B: 200 SOLD
        Note over B: HELD -> CONFIRMED<br/>save response under k1
        B--)N: POST /notifications (best effort)
        B-->>C: 200 {status: CONFIRMED}
    else Failure path: gateway DOWN or SLOW
        G--xP: 503 / timeout
        P-->>B: 503 PAYMENT_GATEWAY_UNAVAILABLE
        Note over B,P: release pay_lock, drop k1 (retryable)<br/>booking stays HELD
        B-->>C: 503 (client may retry with k1)
        Note over C,G: gateway recovers
        C->>B: POST /bookings/{id}/pay (same Idempotency-Key: k1)
        B->>P: POST /payments (Idempotency-Key: k1)
        P->>G: POST /charge
        G-->>P: 200 APPROVED
        P-->>B: 201 {paymentId, APPROVED}
        B->>S: POST /seats/confirm
        S-->>B: 200 SOLD
        B-->>C: 200 {status: CONFIRMED}
    end
